This is a PUBLIC, throwaway RSA-3072 development signing key. It is committed on
purpose so `make firmware-artifacts` and the QEMU images are signed: a dev build
then installs over the air like a release unit and carries the embedded public
key that verifies the next dev-signed update. Because the private key is public,
it provides integrity for dev/DIY builds, NOT authenticity. Product/release
images are signed with the maintainer's secret key (CI). Never trust this key
for anything that must be authentic. See docs/ota.md and docs/security.md.
